      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pittman_Center%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits just above Webb Creek and the Middle Fork of the Little Pigeon River, near its northern tip.",
